            <div class="col-md-4">
              <label class="form-label">OCR Model</label>
              <input type="text" class="form-control font-monospace" name="ocrModel" value="<%= form.ocrModel %>" />
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-4">
              <label class="form-label">NVIDIA OCR API Key</label>
              <input type="password" class="form-control" name="ocrApiKey" placeholder="<%= form.hasOcrApiKey ? 'Keep stored OCR key' : 'Paste NVIDIA OCR key' %>" />
              <div class="form-check mt-2">
                <input class="form-check-input" type="checkbox" name="clearOcrApiKey" id="clearOcrApiKey" />
                <label class="form-check-label small" for="clearOcrApiKey">Clear saved OCR key</label>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col-12">
              <label class="form-label">OCR Endpoint</label>
              <input type="url" class="form-control font-monospace" name="ocrEndpoint" value="<%= form.ocrEndpoint %>" />
              <div class="form-text">This is separate from invoice AI. Use <code>https://ai.api.nvidia.com/v1/cv/nvidia/nemotron-ocr-v1</code>.</div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <hr class="my-4" />

          <div class="d-flex flex-wrap justify-content-between align-items-center gap-2 mb-3">
            <h2 class="h4 mb-0">Background Scheduler</h2>
            <button type="submit" name="settingsSection" value="scheduler" class="btn btn-sm btn-primary">
              Save Scheduler
            </button>
          </div>
          <div class="row g-3">
            <div class="col-12">
              <div class="form-check">
                <input class="form-check-input" type="checkbox" name="schedulerEnabled" id="schedulerEnabled" <%= form.schedulerEnabled ? 'checked' : '' %> />
                <label class="form-check-label" for="schedulerEnabled">
                  Enable automatic processing for confirmed Sales Orders from April 8, 2026 onward
                </label>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-4">
              <label class="form-label">Interval Minutes</label>
              <input type="number" min="1" class="form-control" name="schedulerIntervalMinutes" value="<%= form.schedulerIntervalMinutes %>" />
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-4">
              <label class="form-label">Batch Size</label>
              <input type="number" min="1" class="form-control" name="schedulerBatchSize" value="<%= form.schedulerBatchSize %>" />
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-4">
              <label class="form-label">Confirmed From Date</label>
              <input type="text" class="form-control font-monospace" name="schedulerConfirmedFromDate" value="<%= form.schedulerConfirmedFromDate %>" />
              <div class="form-text">Uses Odoo datetime format. Default cutoff is <code>2026-04-08 00:00:00</code>.</div>
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-8">
              <label class="form-label">Cron Token</label>
              <input type="text" class="form-control font-monospace" name="schedulerCronToken" value="<%= form.schedulerCronToken %>" />
              <div class="form-text">Use this token from cPanel cron when calling the scheduler endpoint.</div>
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-4">
              <div class="form-check mt-md-4 pt-md-2">
                <input class="form-check-input" type="checkbox" name="schedulerUseInProcessInterval" id="schedulerUseInProcessInterval" <%= form.schedulerUseInProcessInterval ? 'checked' : '' %> />
                <label class="form-check-label" for="schedulerUseInProcessInterval">
                  Also run in-process interval scheduler
                </label>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col-12">
              <div class="alert alert-light border small mb-0" role="alert">
                Recommended setup: use <strong>cron only</strong> on cPanel and leave in-process interval off. The scheduler now keeps a persistent run lock and a rolling checkpoint with a 24-hour lookback window to reduce duplicate rescans while still retrying recent work safely.
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <hr class="my-4" />

          <div class="d-flex flex-wrap justify-content-between align-items-center gap-2 mb-3">
            <h2 class="h4 mb-0">PO Bill Background Scheduler</h2>
            <button type="submit" name="settingsSection" value="poBillScheduler" class="btn btn-sm btn-primary">
              Save PO Scheduler
            </button>
          </div>
          <div class="row g-3">
            <div class="col-12">
              <div class="form-check">
                <input class="form-check-input" type="checkbox" name="poBillSchedulerEnabled" id="poBillSchedulerEnabled" <%= form.poBillSchedulerEnabled ? 'checked' : '' %> />
                <label class="form-check-label" for="poBillSchedulerEnabled">
                  Enable automatic PO bill matching for Finance folder PDFs
                </label>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-3">
              <label class="form-label">Interval Minutes</label>
              <input type="number" min="1" class="form-control" name="poBillSchedulerIntervalMinutes" value="<%= form.poBillSchedulerIntervalMinutes %>" />
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-3">
              <label class="form-label">Batch Size</label>
              <input type="number" min="1" max="1" class="form-control" name="poBillSchedulerBatchSize" value="1" readonly />
              <div class="form-text">Runs 1 Finance PDF per cycle.</div>
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-6">
              <label class="form-label">Match POs From Date</label>
              <input type="text" class="form-control font-monospace" name="poBillSchedulerFromDate" value="<%= form.poBillSchedulerFromDate %>" />
              <div class="form-text">Use <code>2026-01-01 00:00:00</code> to match unbilled POs from January 1, 2026 onward.</div>
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-8">
              <label class="form-label">PO Bill Cron Token</label>
              <input type="text" class="form-control font-monospace" name="poBillSchedulerCronToken" value="<%= form.poBillSchedulerCronToken %>" />
              <div class="form-text">Optional. If blank, the PO bill cron endpoint accepts the main scheduler token.</div>
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-4">
              <div class="form-check mt-md-4 pt-md-2">
                <input class="form-check-input" type="checkbox" name="poBillSchedulerUseInProcessInterval" id="poBillSchedulerUseInProcessInterval" <%= form.poBillSchedulerUseInProcessInterval ? 'checked' : '' %> />
                <label class="form-check-label" for="poBillSchedulerUseInProcessInterval">
                  Also run PO bill in-process interval
                </label>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col-12">
              <div class="alert alert-light border small mb-0" role="alert">
                Cron URL: <code><%= `${appBaseUrl}/jobs/run-po-bill-scheduler?token=${form.poBillSchedulerCronToken || form.schedulerCronToken || 'set-a-token-in-settings'}` %></code>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <hr class="my-4" />

          <div class="d-flex flex-wrap justify-content-between align-items-center gap-2 mb-3">
            <h2 class="h4 mb-0">Stock Reconciliation Configuration</h2>
            <button type="submit" name="settingsSection" value="stock" class="btn btn-sm btn-primary">
              Save Stock
            </button>
          </div>
          <div class="row g-3">
            <div class="col-md-6">
              <label class="form-label">Stock Location ID</label>
              <input
                type="text"
                class="form-control font-monospace"
                name="stockLocationId"
                value="<%= form.stockLocationId %>"
                placeholder="Preferred when known"
              />
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-6">
              <label class="form-label">Stock Location Fallback Name</label>
              <input
                type="text"
                class="form-control"
                name="stockLocationName"
                value="<%= form.stockLocationName %>"
                placeholder="Used when Location ID is blank"
              />
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-6">
              <label class="form-label">Warehouse ID (optional)</label>
              <input
                type="text"
                class="form-control font-monospace"
                name="stockWarehouseId"
                value="<%= form.stockWarehouseId %>"
              />
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-6">
              <label class="form-label">Picking Type ID (optional)</label>
              <input
                type="text"
                class="form-control font-monospace"
                name="stockPickingTypeId"
                value="<%= form.stockPickingTypeId %>"
              />
            </div>
            <div class="col-12">
              <label class="form-label">Missing Sales Order Items Alert User (optional)</label>
              <input
                type="text"
                class="form-control"
                name="stockMissingSoAlertUserLogin"
                value="<%= form.stockMissingSoAlertUserLogin %>"
                placeholder="user@example.com"
              />
              <div class="form-text">
                When set, chatter for extracted edging items missing from the Sales Order will prepend a mention-style name and address the alert to this Odoo user.
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col-12">
              <label class="form-label">Missing BOM Component Alert User (optional)</label>
              <input
                type="text"
                class="form-control"
                name="stockMissingComponentAlertUserLogin"
                value="<%= form.stockMissingComponentAlertUserLogin %>"
                placeholder="user@example.com"
              />
              <div class="form-text">
                When set, chatter for missing BOM components will prepend a mention-style name and address the alert to this Odoo user.
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="alert alert-light border small mt-3 mb-0" role="alert">
            cPanel recommendation: leave in-process interval off and trigger the scheduler from cron using a protected URL. This is more reliable when Passenger sleeps idle apps.
          </div>

          <div class="mt-4 d-flex flex-wrap gap-2">
            <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary px-4">Save All Settings</button>
            <a href="/dashboard" class="btn btn-link text-decoration-none">Back to Dashboard</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </form>
</main>

<%- include('partials/footer') %>
